{"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GrafluentCollections\/documentation\/GrafluentCollections\/ChoosingASearchTree","doc:\/\/GrafluentCollections\/documentation\/GrafluentCollections\/TriesAndSuffixStructures","doc:\/\/GrafluentCollections\/documentation\/GrafluentCollections\/DecisionDiagrams","doc:\/\/GrafluentCollections\/documentation\/GrafluentCollections\/RangeAndSpatialTrees"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Guides","title":"Guides"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The collections keep their vertices in flat arrays private to each type. To look at a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"collection’s shape, convert it to the Grafluent type of that shape. The conversion is an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"initializer on the Grafluent type and costs O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") once; the result is a snapshot, and later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edits to the collection don’t reach it:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import GrafluentCollections","import Trees","","var primes: AVLTree = [2, 3, 5]","let shape = BinaryTree(primes)!   \/\/ nil when the collection is empty","primes.insert(7)","shape.vertexCount                 \/\/ 3"]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Collection","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Grafluent type","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVLTree"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVLDictionary"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RedBlackTree"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Treap"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SplayTree"}]}],[{"typ